{"id":"1d1387be254aae2b","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-arslanov.md","title":"Arslanov 完全性判据","display":"thm-arslanov — Arslanov 完全性判据","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-arslanov","aliases":["20-thm-arslanov"],"display":"thm-arslanov — Arslanov 完全性判据","chapter":"5","section":"5.4.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.4.3","source_pdf_pages":[153],"source_printed_pages":[118],"depends_on":["[[20-df-fpf]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-tred]]","[[20-df-K]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","[[20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus]]","[[20-thm-recursion-parameters]]","[[20-df-teq]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-arslanov"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-arslanov</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-arslanov — Arslanov 完全性判据"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.4.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.4.3"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>153</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>118</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fecd8e75f6904d75\" href=\"?note=fecd8e75f6904d75\" title=\"20-df-fpf\">20-df-fpf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d1590e1a5b9442b9\" href=\"?note=d1590e1a5b9442b9\" title=\"20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus\">20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\((\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 是全定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-可计算索引函数族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FPF}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{FPF}(f)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall e\\,[W_{f(e)}\\ne W_e]\">\\(\\forall e\\,[W_{f(e)}\\ne W_e]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_s\">\\(K_s\\)</span> 为固定阶段枚举。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fecd8e75f6904d75\" href=\"?note=fecd8e75f6904d75\" title=\"20-df-fpf\">20-df-fpf</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0e6b2238da5572e4\" href=\"?note=0e6b2238da5572e4\" title=\"20-df-K\">20-df-K</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"de54fb8c1326b2f0\" href=\"?note=de54fb8c1326b2f0\" title=\"20-thm-K-one-complete\">20-thm-K-one-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"d1590e1a5b9442b9\" href=\"?note=d1590e1a5b9442b9\" title=\"20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus\">20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"4f81acfa76416d15\" href=\"?note=4f81acfa76416d15\" title=\"20-thm-recursion-parameters\">20-thm-recursion-parameters</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arslanov}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_TK\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{FPF}(f)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}arslanov}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_TK\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{FPF}(f)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_TK\">\\(A\\equiv_TK\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 可决定 c.e. 谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W_e\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。固定空集和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0\\}\">\\(\\{0\\}\\)</span> 的两个索引；前者在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 非空时输出，后者在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 空时输出，得到全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-可计算、每个域均与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 不同的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>反向给全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\le_TA\">\\(f\\le_TA\\)</span> 且无外延固定点。c.e. oracle 近似模定理给全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat f(e,s)\">\\(\\widehat f(e,s)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\le_TA\">\\(m\\le_TA\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\ge m(e)\">\\(s\\ge m(e)\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat f(e,s)=f(e)\">\\(\\widehat f(e,s)=f(e)\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)\">\\(\\theta(x)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 首入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 的阶段。参数递归定理给全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\">\\(x\\in K\\)</span>，其域复制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{\\widehat f(h(x),\\theta(x))}\">\\(W_{\\widehat f(h(x),\\theta(x))}\\)</span>，否则域为空。复制过程在看到入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 后开始即可，最终域等于整集，不要求入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 前已枚举其全部成员。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\">\\(x\\in K\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta(x)\\ge m(h(x))\">\\(\\theta(x)\\ge m(h(x))\\)</span>，复制集就是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{f(h(x))}\">\\(W_{f(h(x))}\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{h(x)}=W_{f(h(x))}\">\\(W_{h(x)}=W_{f(h(x))}\\)</span>，违背 FPF。于是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in K\\iff x\\in K_{m(h(x))},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in K\\iff x\\in K_{m(h(x))},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 求模后作有限模拟给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_TA\">\\(K\\le_TA\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> c.e. 给反向归约。证明中 c.e. 前提用于取得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-可计算稳定模，全定义前提保证该模在所有参数处存在。FPF 仍指 c.e. 域的外延不等；函数程序本身的固定点及 DNC 条件的等价另见已有专门原子。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 118 / PDF 153。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-fpf","status":"resolved","id":"fecd8e75f6904d75","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-fpf]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-K","status":"resolved","id":"0e6b2238da5572e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-K]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-one-complete","status":"resolved","id":"de54fb8c1326b2f0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-one-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-ce-oracle-approximation-modulus","status":"resolved","id":"d1590e1a5b9442b9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":""